@startuml state_diagram
' Forecast run lifecycle

hide empty description

[*] --> Queued
Queued --> Running : start(worker available)
Running --> Succeeded : all lines reconciled
Running --> Failed : error / retry budget exhausted
Failed --> Queued : retry
Succeeded --> [*]

state Running {
  [*] --> Scoring
  Scoring --> Reconciling : scores ready
  Reconciling --> Publishing : MinT complete
  Publishing --> [*]
}

note right of Failed
  Last-good forecast may be
  served (degraded mode)
end note
@enduml